{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的感受短句连续出现时不如X左右分栏那么容易快速区分叙事与氛围，部分段落也有意象堆叠、注意力被分散的问题。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的左右分栏很直观，叙事和感受各在一边，扫读时比较省力，但部分感受词与音乐具体进程的联系不够紧。Y用加亮关键词让每段的情绪转折和人物动机更容易被抓住，又通过到时出现的感受词把音乐变化、身体反应和心理活动对应起来，尤其在由亲近、期待到不安、接受的过程中，细腻程度和前后呼应都更好。虽然Y偶尔显得密集，但作为边听边看的体验，我更愿意选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "de95eb60-df6a-4eb4-9759-477ea2f0e111", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T010707684585Z", "elapsed_seconds": 59.437, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:08:07.130059+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c1d5a40465eb83f90b4951cbdda3b4d4a1e3256d7f88963d2a8700eba57ba0a3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attac